Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in community college\Nwhen I first crossed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paths with that buzzkill\Nof a man I call my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned out he went to one of\Nthe ritzier colleges in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends at the time thought he\Nwas dreamy and fawned over the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that I was the girl on his\Narm made me feel a bit superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we had a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it because it's three\Ntimes faster. The picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh come on. Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that my husband's a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even a heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he might not bring home a big\Npaycheck, but he's a damn hard worker.
