Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so, I fell into a marriage\Nwithout ever knowing love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's finally home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever hear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is where's dinner, make me\Na bath, I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what a bore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you're finally home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even hear you open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was too busy to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your favorite's on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if he's man enough\Nto do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna sit there stuffing your\Nface in silence like you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Mariah Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai Howard here, your neighborhood\Npurveyor of good lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is everyone on this fine night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to ease you\Ninto a mellow journey.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.81,0:02:15.78,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 25: {\fs80} Atom Heart Father
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found his house about 15\Nminutes away from Mariah Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in a part of town known\Nfor its views and villas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it was his former house,\Nwhere he lived as Yoshikage Kira.
