Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he has a new face, a new job,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a new place to call home, and\Nprobably even a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious that he's\Nnever turning up here again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but just the same, we still\Nhave to search the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're going to find any clues as\Nto where this new man ran off to,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to find them\Nright here in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh given how much that kid looks\Nlike our guy this must be his album
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira he was born in Mariah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on January 30th 1966 he's nearly two
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meters tall he weighs 65 kilograms\Nand his blood type is A he was born
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to older parents when he was 21 his\Nfather Yoshihiro fell ill and died
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems his mother died soon after.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Graduated in 1988 with\Na degree in literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same year, he starts at Kameyu in S-City,\Nand in 1993 transfers to the Mariah branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no previous criminal record,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has never married, has no\Nclose friends or lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never even had a surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't find him with fingerprints,\Ndental records, or surgical scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're trying to say\Nis we've reached a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trophies and plaques\Nthey all say third
