Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.62,Episode 25 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1080,897.2)\be0.1\frz7.1}Middle School Track Meet\N200 Meter Hurdles\N3rd Place\NKira Yoshikage
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place so he certainly\Nwasn't a star athlete.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.12,Episode 25 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1c&H2F2D31&\be0.1\pos(1355.2,477.2)\frz5.833}Award\NGrade School\NWriting Contest\NOverall 3rd Place
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.12,Episode 25 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1c&H2F2D31&\frz5.943\pos(916.8,520.4)\be(0.1)}Award\NGrade School\NWriting Contest\NOverall 3rd Place
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing speaks to his\Ntalents was it sports music
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:04:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,writing even here he's\Ntrying not to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never been the\Nobject of ridicule or envy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he never reveals his\Nstrengths or weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to anyone which means\Nit's all been a deception
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's been hiding his talent and intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew laying low would be the\Nbest way to stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hope in coming here was\Nto find hobbies or interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any clue in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hobbies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have found one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some weird reason, he keeps a\Nbunch of jars in this drawer. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, this looks like\Na collection of bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is with the numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1983. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pee-yew, they smell rancid. What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they're fingernail clippings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose nails do you\Nthink they are? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not from his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those clippings are his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kept meticulous notes on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those numbers on the jars?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean he's been collecting\Nthese things since 1983?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1983?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 15 years of yuck!
