Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are details about every finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to this, in 1983,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his right thumb grew a nail that\Nwas 31 and a half centimeters long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure 1983 was the\Nyear Reimi Sugimoto was murdered!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the records begin in that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably reached a\Npoint where he couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,repress his murderous impulses any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all the info he\Ncollected about his toenails!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boring office worker seems to\Nhave a very interesting hobby.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.69,0:05:45.11,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: My nails grew more than 30cm. I'm on a roll!! No one can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a form of divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's similar to ancient\NJewish merchants who once
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,observed sunspots to\Npredict economic prospects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears Yoshikage\NKira is tying his nail
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,growth to his physical\Nand mental preparedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His preparedness to kill, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out 1999!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By June of this year, they'd\Nalready grown over 20 centimeters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was crazy, but this is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with you, but this\Nwon't help us track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There might be something else we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think someone's skulking\Naround the house under our noses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, stay on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have been maybe\Nworking with a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too cautious for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More people means more risk for capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A partner could just rat him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't even consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, quickly, look at the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Kira's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's behind us, just sitting\Nin the corner. Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a shitload of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we actually dealing with a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, considering Raimi's situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's entirely possible that his\Nfather is stuck in some kind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of spiritual limbo between the\Nland of the living and the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at his expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like he wants\Nus to make a quick exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to give us the\Nwillies with your spooky ghost energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks, but we can't leave with\Nall this paranormal shit going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the damn phone, slacker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear me calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think my face is saying take a hike?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you couldn't be more wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were looking at the face of a man who
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will never allow you to\Nleave this house alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you for going\Nafter my son! Oh, fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know about all the\Ncrimes your son has committed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, what's with\Nall the racket in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself your geriatric ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, I don't think he's hiding at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's father has been in the room\Nthe entire time watching us you see.
