Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the hell did he he's able\Nto move around in the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it stands to reason he made\Nthe call from in there and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he threw the phone at you from\Ninside the picture as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you dare go after my dearest son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we can't physically\Nfight a ghost, our stance can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the day we met Reimi, Rohan sensei\Nused Tevin's door to read her memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage inflicted on the\Nphotograph backfires to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix it now, Josuke, or\Nwe'll be ripped to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, you\Nguys are back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's all making sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You whelps have special\Nabilities, like my son's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to do your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hurry up and use the hand to\Ncut this crusty old man out of the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just leave everything\Nto me, Chillscape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd I run straight into the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys see my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something stopping me from\Ncoming into the room with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but there's an invisible\Nwall blocking anyone from entering!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't think I can break it! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This photo is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invisible wall that\Nyou're so worked up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about is actually the\Nedge of this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a ghost who lives out\Nhis days in a photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can control the space of\Nany picture in which I appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By using that camera, I trap a person's\Nspiritual energy within a photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room you're in is inside the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damaging the photo means damaging\Nthe spiritual energy too,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which won't end well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make a lick of sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we in the picture\Nif I'm looking right at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're clearly not the brightest,\Nso I'll spill it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I kill these two fools,\NI'll ensnare you and the brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and shred you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,J-Jusuke! Mr. Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, why are you just standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Star Platinum is super powerful,\Nso hurry up and do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Josuke, but I'm gonna\Nhave to throw in the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping that old-timers\Nattacks is downright impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every bit of damage we throw at him\Nwill only come right back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum could stop time,\Nbut there's really no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die! Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heads have got\Nsome good spin to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, he's got a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't touch it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've given up on stopping the geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's being honest, it can really\Ncontrol any photograph he's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe the best way to win is to take a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shot of him so he's in\Nthe picture by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found a way to sidestep\Nmy attack entirely! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give our\Nfriend here a nice send-off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make sure you add a\Nlittle bit of style to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you weren't so\Nbig and bad after all fool!
