Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Underestimated you, but I\Nsee you're seasoned fighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.94,0:13:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got lots of experience battling\Nopponents with special abilities like my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the old farts a ghost\Nhe can get out of the picture
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to make sure you\Nbehave yourself and stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something in this house\Nyou really don't want us to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're attacking us\Nwith so much fervor, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fold that crusty old prune in\Nhalf, there's no way he can get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we win this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu and Koichi search this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and I have got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't protect my son\Nif I'm trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:13:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it falls into their\Nhands, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could he be hiding\Nthat's so important
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd do all this to\Nkeep us from finding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the foggiest clue,\Nbut I'm not going to sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the old man turns white as a\Nsheet, we should be good. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's torture in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't I have a bit of air?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just poke a couple of holes in the\Ntape and let me catch my breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seriously can't breathe in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pulling your leg, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants you to make an\Nopening so he can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you don't trust me, but I\Nreally am dying in here, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about this, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm claustrophobic, so I sort of get\Nwhat the poor guy's going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit your bitchin', geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really need a breathing hole\Nthat bad, I'm more than happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, how's that working out for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a little tacky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, get me out of here,\Nyou wretched little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you caught your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tacks ain't going nowhere, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tax, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must mean you stuck me to the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a red-letter day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots don't realize it, but\Nthose tacks are my ticket out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have planned it better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much obliged, suckers. So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you pruney old bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your mouth, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we might have messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he really used\Nthe tacks to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jojuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's father got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mess is only happening because of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stuck some tacks in it\Nand he did something weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been duped, my blockhead friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a battle of wits and you lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean he was faking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.56,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is the bow and\Narrow, but why is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already retrieved them from Otoishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the Speedwagon\NFoundation was guarding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this another set?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's father has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the very arrow that\Nbrought forth Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever wields it holds all the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you take it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use Reverb, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sick Act 1 on him! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already too far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least now we know what Kira's father\Nwas trying to stop us from finding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was hiding another bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He simply outsmarted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That geezer's definitely Kira's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna fight to\Nsurvive at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their unrelenting resolve is\Nwhat's getting the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as those chumps don't\Nget this arrow, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the meantime, I'll use it to\Nmake even more enemies for them to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling there\Nmight be more than one set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would explain how Dio\Nand his henchmen were able to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pull together such a large\Ngroup of stand users so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They built an army of minions across the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,globe using multiple\Nsets of bows and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:18:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's father probably obtained\Nthis set from Inyaba the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we already know Okuyasu's\Nbrother Keicho came into
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possession of one at some point\Nbefore they arrived in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand users really do seem\Nto be drawn to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Yoshikage, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as a little boy, you couldn't\Nrepress your urges to kill women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's what makes you happy,\NI'll support and protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my duty as a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, as you're my one and only\Nson, I'll do all I can for you.
