Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say I've ever seen\Nthis side of you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, since when do you know\Nyour way around a kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not some kind of prank, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two plates here,\Nso I assume one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly think I'd eat\Nsomething you slopped together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think now is the\Nbest time to cut your nails?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you cut them\Nlast night, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure grow fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.14,0:19:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is actually delicious!
