Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to tell\Nyou to leave it open!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness, what's\Nthe matter, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting so worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess cats aren't the\Nbiggest fans of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking and acted carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's definitely something\Nstrange going on with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First he starts cooking for\Nme out of the blue and now
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's using an actual blade\Ninstead of his electric razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blades always give him razor burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, pal, you still haven't\Npaid last month's rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cheapskate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you owe for this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fork over the yen,\Nnot leave until I'm paid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and get the money from the\Nsafe before he kicks us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ride the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking the\Ntime to drop by this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I appear to be running a\Nbit short on cash at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that hair gel must be\Nseeping into your noggin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known you young deadbeats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be able to\Nafford my gorgeous home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I get for doing\Nbusiness with schmucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn to live within your means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get your money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think you misunderstood me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I was short on cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I meant that I only\Nhad a little over $500,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll only be able to pay for this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last month, and for the next\Ncouple of months in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will that suffice for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that'll do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but you\Nmust have stolen that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point trying\Nto say that you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stole it from the\Nlandlord's bag, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone else was in this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be horrified that their\Npartner could do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he stole the money\Nand lied about it so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been with him for so many years, but\Nhe's never made me feel like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exhilarating!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm falling in love\Nwith him for the first time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.43,0:22:53.81,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime I need to see your\Nface, it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.81,0:22:56.06,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taking two bits\Nfor your crystal mind!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magenta feeling, take a\Nshelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.85,0:23:00.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a Chaka cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.52,0:23:02.90,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.90,0:23:05.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.28,0:23:08.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the humic.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.07,0:23:09.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.78,0:23:12.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.03,0:23:14.37,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.37,0:23:15.99,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know. What hit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.99,0:23:18.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh I want you.
