Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh I want you.
