Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
